title: "JØ7 VIREO: A Low-Cost Offline Edge-AI Assistive Navigation Prototype"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ramnath
    given-names: Jivesh
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-07-29
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
