keywords:
  - assistive technology
  - computer vision
  - edge AI
  - Raspberry Pi
  - Hailo
  - accessibility
abstract: >-
  JØ7 VIREO is an offline assistive-navigation research prototype combining
  Hailo-accelerated object detection, local speech recognition, audio feedback,
  a voice-controlled camera servo, and an independent directional haptic belt.
